<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Glory, worship, laud and blessing,</l><l>Thus the choir triumphant sings;</l><l>Honor, riches, power, dominion,</l><l>Thus its praise creation brings;</l><l>Thou art worthy, Thou art worthy,</l><l>Lord of lords, and King of kings.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Glory to the King of angels,</l><l>Glory to the Church’s King,</l><l>Glory to the King of nations,</l><l>Heaven and earth His praises sing;</l><l>Glory ever and forever</l><l>To the King of Glory bring.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
